  "cohort_validation": "Every router matrix has exactly B real rows; 1 prefill + 8 decode, no mixed; 16 layers and 8 complete distinct decode steps, all forwards completed. Separate trace pass emits 9 total tokens/request; timed performance pass emits 8 and is not the F1 denominator.",
  "boundaries": [
    "Short diagnostic: one capture and fixed nested prefix cohort per B, not independent arrival process or repeated system runs.",
    "64 distinct WikiText validation windows come from 60 source articles; prefixes are truncated to 32 tokens.",
    "Fitted q is estimated in sample from 8*B tokens per layer; observed versus fitted difference is not an iid validation or rejection.",
    "No uncertainty interval treats layers, tokens or steps as independent system repetitions.",
    "Host-synchronized route traces measure occupancy only, not TPOT, bandwidth, or energy.",
    "Left-panel topologies are analytical, only OLMoE native routes are measured."
  ],
  "plot_adaptation": "Existing plot_occupancy.main; right x axis uses log2 with integer labels so B=1,2,4 ticks remain legible; all input points retained."
